=== Text #15 ===
> I believe that focusing on your health and mental health is one of the most important things a person can do. I did[.] Now I'm in debt.
I started getting sick in September 2017. I decided to take[ charge] of my health, including my mental health. I got a new PCP. I was referred to seven different specialists. I have had tests upon tests. I have had surgery. I have been put on several medications. I have insurance (thank God). The co-pays and medical bills are piling up. I'll have to get a job or two to keep up.
